WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:09.890
Map the impact of the Kårböle fire. Sentinel-2 captures the landscape affected by the July 2018 wildfire near Ljusdal.

00:00:11.010 --> 00:00:16.610
A pre-fire image gives context for interpreting the observed change.

00:00:18.010 --> 00:00:23.770
The difference in Normalized Burn Ratio highlights areas with different levels of change.

00:00:25.010 --> 00:00:31.730
Thresholds are indicative for this forest setting. Combine the map with local evidence when assessing damage.
